    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n\\text { 解得 } x = 1. 3 0 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {4}, y = 1. 5 4 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {4},\\tag{1 分}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n\\text{接触不良颗粒百分比} = y / (x + y) = 1.542 / 2.85 = 54.1 \\%\\tag{1 分}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "给分原则："
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "本小问共 8 分，扩散电流正确 3 分，接触电流正确 1 分，颗粒总数正确 1 分，正确列方程组 1 分，正确解方程组 1 分（只要 y 正确就可得 1 分，y 错误不得分），答案 1 分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "若以 $Q_{0} = 3.6 \\times 10^{-12} \\, C,\\quad D = 3.0 \\times 10^{3} \\, nm^{2} \\, s^{-1},$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "得 $|I|=\\left|\\mathrm{d}Q/\\mathrm{d}t\\right|=\\left|\\frac{\\pi^{2}D}{4L^{2}}Q_{0}e^{-\\frac{\\pi^{2}D}{4L^{2}}t}\\right|$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 分"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n= \\left| \\frac {\\pi^ {2} \\times 3 . 0 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {3} \\mathrm{nm} ^ {2} \\mathrm{s} ^ {- 1}}{4 \\times (1 8 0 \\mathrm{nm}) ^ {2}} \\times 3. 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 1 2} \\mathrm{C} \\times e ^ {- \\frac {\\pi^ {2} \\times 3 . 0 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {3} \\mathrm{nm} ^ {2} \\mathrm{s} ^ {- 1}}{4 \\times (1 8 0 \\mathrm{nm}) ^ {2}} \\times 1 0. 0 0 \\mathrm{s}} \\right|\\tag{1 分}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n= 0. 0 8 3 7 \\mathrm{pA}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 分，至此步共 3 分"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "若接触电阻 $R = 2.00 \\times 10^{13} \\Omega$ ， $I_{2} = 0.500 V / R = 0.0250 pA$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 分"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "电极表面 PBA-1 颗粒的总个数"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\nN = \\frac {m}{m _ {L}} = \\frac {m}{(L / a) ^ {3} / 2 \\cdot M _ {r} / N _ {A}}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n= 0. 3 1 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 9} / \\left(\\left(\\frac {1 8 0}{0 . 5 1 0}\\right) ^ {3} / 2 \\times \\frac {3 0 6 . 9 2}{6 . 0 2 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {2 3}}\\right) = 2. 8 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {4}\\tag{1 分}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "联立方程组"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\nx + y = 2. 8 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {4}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n0. 0 8 3 7 x + 0. 0 2 5 0 y = 1 3 8 5. 7 6\\tag{1 分}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "x 为扩散速率控制的颗粒个数，y 为接触电阻控制的颗粒个数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "解得， $x=1.15\\times10^{4},y=1.70\\times10^{4}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 分"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "接触不良颗粒百分比= $y/(x+y)=1.70/2.85=59.6\\%$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 分"
    }
  ]
